    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69721" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νάπη</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], ἡ</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>woodland vale, dell, glen</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				8.558
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀπολλωνία ν</span>., of Delphi,
				<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				6.9
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				546
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				11
			</span></i> (Delph., <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>GDI</u>
				5016.9
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Gortyn</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νάπαι κάλλισται</span> pleasant <i>valleys</i> about a
			town, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.157
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χείμαρρος νάπη</span> a torrent
				<i>glen</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				1093
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἢν ἀπόροις νάπαις ἐντυγχάνωσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Eq.Mag.</u>
					4.4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				9.11
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρη δάσκια καὶ νάπαι πετρώδεις
					βρέμονται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Th.</u>
					998
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Av.</u>
				740
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				761b
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νάπος</span>.</div>
